; Historical motivating abort shape, now repaired by the recursive-type boundary: a NAMED
; self-referential collection (`x = [* x]`) that ANOTHER rule holds. The former transparent
; `pub type X = Vec<X>;` alias both made the standalone shape fail with E0391 and let the holder's
; serializer recurse without a base case until it aborted. The boundary now auto-`@newtype`s the
; collection-backed rule, reusing the nominal wrapper a hand-written directive would produce.
;
; This remains a supported regression pin: both the holder and standalone forms must generate
; cleanly. Every robustness-catalog row runs in its own child, so a future non-unwinding regression
; here is classified as `ABORTED (signal <n>)` instead of terminating the catalog.
x = [* x]
hold = [a: x]
